      "updated": 1790572690881,
      "created": 1790570275592,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Suppose retrieved chunk: 500 words ka hai.\n\nBut actual useful part: 50 words hai.\nToh unnecessary 450 words LLM ko bhejne ki zarurat nahi.\n\n500-word chunk\n↓\nRelevant 50 words\n↓\nLLM\n\nBenefits: less noise, less tokens , less cost, better focus",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Suppose retrieved chunk: 500 words ka hai.\n\nBut actual useful part: 50 words hai.\nToh unnecessary 450 words LLM ko bhejne ki zarurat nahi.\n\n500-word chunk\n↓\nRelevant 50 words\n↓\nLLM\n\nBenefits: less noise, less tokens , less cost, better focus",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
