      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790572690881,
      "created": 1790571172114,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User:\n\"wo leave wala rule batao\"\n\nYe vague hai.\n\nSystem samajhne ki koshish karega:\n\nIntent → leave policy ke baare me question\nPossible target → employee leave policy\n\nFir query rewrite ho sakti hai:\n\n\"What is the company's employee leave policy?\"\n\nSo:\n\nQuery Understanding\n= user actually kya chahta hai, ye samajhna",
      "fontSize": 16.591275508894604,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User:\n\"wo leave wala rule batao\"\n\nYe vague hai.\n\nSystem samajhne ki koshish karega:\n\nIntent → leave policy ke baare me question\nPossible target → employee leave policy\n\nFir query rewrite ho sakti hai:\n\n\"What is the company's employee leave policy?\"\n\nSo:\n\nQuery Understanding\n= user actually kya chahta hai, ye samajhna",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
